# in it. The graph (format 6) has a prebuilt unit `example/nsshim@0.1.0#mojo1.0.0/lib`, which the macro declares as `:prebuilt_nsshim` (and the download
# `:prebuilt_nsshim.conda`), named by the import name; `lib/mojo/nsshim.mojoc` and `lib/libnsshim.a` come out of the `.conda`, and the test links the archive.
